fold-panel-by-data-split.R contains the code for external validation.

internal-fold-panel-by-data-split.R contains the code for internal validation
based on the training set given by the validation set. E.g. for validation set
6, we have 10 in the test set. This file will run internal validation with
CV (user supplied parameters) on the remaining 65 samples.

The shell scripts are to help me run the analysis. You can check them for the parameters that 
I have supplied. Please note that they will not work here, as I have changed file names.